  "sourceSummary": "Steel Supplements original reverse-grip pushdown section explicitly allows EZ attachment and palms on underside with supinated grip, elbows tucked and near90degree start/return. M&F reverse-grip pressdown corroborates high pulley, stable elbows and controlled extension but uses straight bar. Only form details used; muscle-isolation promotional claims are not adopted. Video uses soft5degree finish and editorial8second repetition.",
